# Firebase web config for PM Path's sign-in and sync, used by production builds on every host
# (Vercel, GitHub Pages, Netlify…). These are public identifiers, not secrets: they ship in the
# site's JavaScript anyway, and firestore.rules is what protects each person's data.
# Running your own copy? Replace these with your Firebase project's values, or delete this file
# to build without sign-in.
